# Canonical LF everywhere. witness-bench fingerprints witness.mjs's bytes into the Proof-of-Play
# anchor; CRLF on a Windows checkout vs LF on a Linux runner would make the same code fingerprint
# differently and the receipt would not reproduce across machines. Force LF so it does.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.witnessbak binary
